{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" initial=\"a\">\n  <state id=\"a\">\n    <log expr=\"'entered'\"/>\n    <transition event=\"go\" target=\"b\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"b\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/xsd-executable-content-misplaced.scxml"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xsd-executable-content-misplaced.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":0,"byteOffset":95,"endColumn":5,"endLine":3,"startColumn":5,"startLine":3},"insertedContent":{"text":"<onentry>"}},{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":0,"byteOffset":118,"endColumn":28,"endLine":3,"startColumn":28,"startLine":3},"insertedContent":{"text":"</onentry>"}}]}],"description":{"text":"run it on entry by wrapping it in `<onentry>`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xsd-executable-content-misplaced.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":9,"endLine":3,"startColumn":6,"startLine":3}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`<log>` is not allowed here inside `<state>`\n\n**Note:** the W3C SCXML 1.0 schema rejects this under XML Schema constraint `cvc-complex-type.2.4`: Element 'log' is not allowed at this position in the content model\n\n**Help:** executable content such as `<log>` belongs inside `<onentry>`, `<onexit>`, or `<transition>`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §4.7 <log>\n\n**Spec:** XML Schema 1.0 Part 1 §3.4.4 Element Locally Valid (Complex Type) (`cvc-complex-type.2.4`)","text":"`<log>` is not allowed here inside `<state>`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":99,"start":96},"category":"schema"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"in the content of this `<state>`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xsd-executable-content-misplaced.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":9,"endLine":2,"startColumn":4,"startLine":2}}}],"ruleId":"XSD-cvc-complex-type.2.4"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"each SCXML element has a fixed content model; for example executable content belongs only in `<onentry>`, `<onexit>`, and `<transition>`"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: move the element to a parent that accepts it, or add the missing children.\n\nSpecification: XML Schema 1.0 Part 1 §3.4.4 Element Locally Valid (Complex Type)\n\nRun `scxml-cli --explain XSD-cvc-complex-type.2.4` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/xmlschema-1/#cvc-complex-type","id":"XSD-cvc-complex-type.2.4","name":"XSD-cvc-complex-type.2.4","properties":{"category":"schema"},"shortDescription":{"text":"a child element is not allowed at this position, or required children are missing"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}